[
  {"comment": "A pattern of a join that merged two of its participants (mitcad#406). Two rings turned about Z by one revolve (Sketch1 F1 on XZ, whose v runs along -Z; Revolve1 F2: F2.b0 at z 0..5, F2.b1 at z 100..105, radii 20..25), a post of 4 mm diameter at (22.5, 0) from z = 0 to 105 (Sketch2 F3, Extrude1 F4) joined to both rings: it merges F2.b1 into F2.b0."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "xz"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [20, -5], "width": 5, "height": 5},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [20, -105], "width": 5, "height": 5},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "revolve",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"},
                 {"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c9[c12,c10],c10[c9,c11],c11[c10,c12],c12[c11,c9]}"}],
    "axis": "z", "extent": {"type": "full"}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"comment": "Each ring pi*(25**2-20**2)*5 = 3534.29 mm3."},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Revolve1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 2, "body": "F2.b1", "volume": 3534.2917352885173,
    "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F3", "center": [22.5, 0], "diameter": 4},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 105}, "operation": "join", "participants": ["F2.b0", "F2.b1"]}},
  {"comment": "The rings and the post between them, pi*(2*1125 + 4*95) = pi*2630 mm3, one body."},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 8262.38867894116,
    "tolerance": 1e-5}},

  {"comment": "Six posts about Z (CircularPattern1, F5): the copies join F2.b0, where F2.b1 went. pi*(2250 + 6*380) = pi*4530 mm3."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "circular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F4"]},
    "axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "z"}, "quantity": 6, "angle": 6.283185307179586}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "CircularPattern1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0",
    "volume": 14231.41472076176, "has_face": "F5:inst3(F4:side(c1))", "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"comment": "Identical: the same."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "circular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F4"]},
    "axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "z"}, "quantity": 6, "angle": 6.283185307179586, "compute": "identical"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "CircularPattern1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0",
    "volume": 14231.41472076176, "tolerance": 1e-5}},

  {"comment": "The participants the other way round: the upper ring keeps its id and takes the copies."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F4", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 105}, "operation": "join", "participants": ["F2.b1", "F2.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "CircularPattern1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b1",
    "volume": 14231.41472076176, "tolerance": 1e-5}}
]
